stion/problem "Which of the following is a factor of ${y}^{2}-8y+17?$" :question/worked-solution "First, we let $f(y)={y}^{2}-8y+17.$\n\nNext, we solve $f(y)=0$ by completing the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(y) & =0 \\\\ {y}^{2}-8y+17 & =0 \\\\ ({y}^{2}-8y+{4}^{2})-{4}^{2}+17 & =0 \\\\ (y-4)^{2}-16+17 & =0 \\\\ (y-4)^{2}+1 & =0 \\\\ (y-4)^{2} & =-1 \\\\ (y-4)^{2} & ={\\text{i}}^{2} \\\\ (y-4)^{2} & =(\\text{i})^{2} \\\\ y-4 & =\\pm \\text{i} \\\\ y & =4\\pm \\text{i}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince our quadratic equation has roots ${y}_{1}=4+\\text{i}$ and ${y}_{2}=4-\\text{i},$ and the coefficient of the quadratic term is $a=1,$ the expression ${y}^{2}-8y+17$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{2}-8y+17 & =a(y-{y}_{1})(y-{y}_{2}) \\\\  & =(y-(4+\\text{i}))(y-(4-\\text{i})).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, among the given options, only $y-(4+\\text{i})$ is a factor of ${y}^{2}-8y+17.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-107696/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ee21c78-209f-564b-a005-86f58699a3be"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107696"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186257116 :question/answer-fields 17592186274310] {:db/id "q-114961/selection/ma-v1/bfc4b8f2c0f7b698282b7e9a782e309abd11f752007b44f6b2597976bc123c5c/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "7752c85f-3405-5a76-a9e2-c4f837460361" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114961/selection/ma-v1/bfc4b8f2c0f7b698282b7e9a782e309abd11f752007b44f6b2597976bc123c5c/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "6f3f1780-e729-5653-8d50-90305dcf183e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114961/selection/ma-v1/bfc4b8f2c0f7b698282b7e9a782e309abd11f752007b44f6b2597976bc123c5c/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f