answer/value "Converges to $-3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123335/selection/4658f74b5ca6579aeba99e88c979e0b03c14aff9c7e8dad99b09fbfe39af5d80" :answer/id #uuid "398e055e-c8eb-51ef-8fdf-c1c15327d178" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{1}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123335/selection/4ca90cd315df631ac085da13fa750f58ec1ba8f2edb61d1b517caeba86607c92" :answer/id #uuid "157b8080-1866-583b-bbe4-350e51103622" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $-\\frac{3}{2}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123335/selection/f5ba9cb7e3373c690e498bc176135d7b1a2093e80dfdec0ef9d7cefcc7228be5" :answer/id #uuid "3120be2e-96ac-5c97-adae-bdccd3bd4a3c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123335/selection/04807305688d046c901dfe9206d434cec6318beb3adc535ab23fa5189b949df5" :answer/id #uuid "097c9ba4-a733-51fe-9045-4a3e0fd98655" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123335/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3eac862d-6b28-515e-83cb-c66e02d4d8d3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-123335/selection/04807305688d046c901dfe9206d434cec6318beb3adc535ab23fa5189b949df5" :answer-field/choices ["q-123335/selection/6b662d51878f124cc8715c2d22ff4f057931f1275f861ffccfb13510036a81d9" "q-123335/selection/4658f74b5ca6579aeba99e88c979e0b03c14aff9c7e8dad99b09fbfe39af5d80" "q-123335/selection/4ca90cd315df631ac085da13fa750f58ec1ba8f2edb61d1b517caeba86607c92" "q-123335/selection/f5ba9cb7e3373c690e498bc176135d7b1a2093e80dfdec0ef9d7cefcc7228be5" "q-123335/selection/04807305688d046c901dfe9206d434cec6318beb3adc535ab23fa5189b949df5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-123335" :question/id #uuid "6ef95098-f281-5be9-9302-145548fa1c3b" :question/math-academy-id "q-123335" :question/problem "Consider the following sequence: \n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{2}{a}_{n},\\,{a}_{1}=-3,\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$\n\nDetermine whether the sequence is convergent or divergent. If it converges, find the limit." :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have a geometric sequence with the first term ${a}_{1}$ and common ratio $r.$ Then, we have the following convergence properties:\n\n- if $|r|<1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence is a geometric sequence with the common ratio \n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{n+1}}{{a}_{n}}=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$\n\nSince $|r|<1$, the sequence converges to $0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-123335/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e4380b34-0502-552b-b94f-e121eb855f1d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123335"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186257134 :question/answer-fields 17592186274314] {:db/id "q-115511/selection/ma-v1/83f975f30c1c09476dedb59d836b37e8c68924f8b4142bc64f951cbb8cde1787/17bd101c5e200548f4018151ab9b82cfb1ddc55903dfee02e659ca1ef52cb030" :answer/id #uuid "b366c2c0-0315-56d9-bb66-b41e7e9793e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-4)^{2}=4(y-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115511/selection/ma-v1/83f975f30c1c09476dedb59d836b37e8c68924f8b4142bc64f951cbb8cde1787/0a3decfd99f59fbffff27f30f651a28aa9986d1d4d939f66e4a3f63d1299cff7" :answer/id #uuid "1abadc92-842b-58eb-a6a7-9ab692f36d77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(x-2)^{2}=-\\frac{1}{3}(y-4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-115511/selection/ma-v1/83f975f30c1c09476dedb59d836b37e8c68924f8b4142bc64f951cbb8cde1787/96804e66da12ab38a3d9656eeb0f1effaafcb49e759a6573049ec9ab92e1cf93" :answer/id #uuid "b1ce34fa-6acb-5ae0-8905-f4e016ed1567" :answer/